# pre-reboot (see 2026-08-11 log context).

## NEW: per-card quadrant affinity now visible (sysfs numa_node per memdev)
# mem0 (e1:00.0) numa_node=3   \ Pair A spans TWO quadrants (0 and 3)
# mem1 (c1:00.0) numa_node=0   /
# mem2 (01:00.0) numa_node=1   \ Pair B both cards in quadrant 1
# mem3 (02:00.0) numa_node=1   /
# => CONFIRMS the E4 topology hypothesis (2026-08-11): Pair A "farther but
# wider" (two I/O paths -> 47.7 GiB/s ceiling), Pair B single-quadrant
